    {
      "id": "p0262-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Over the past 240 pages or so, we've looked at the history behind Underta/e's localization and its official Japanese release. We've studied the changes that were made during the localization process, why those changes were made, and how those changes affected the player's experience.",
        "raw": "Over the past 240 pages or so,\nwe've looked at the history behind\nUnderta/e's localization and its\nofficial Japanese release. We've\nstudied the changes that were made\nduring the localization process, why\nthose changes were made, and how\nthose changes affected the player's\nexperience.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.60794455,
          0.10562857,
          0.88528867,
          0.26415
