    {
      "id": "p0262-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "We've also seen how culture and language are so closely tied together that sometimes a literal translation just isn't possible. We've examined how a single localization choice can affect the gameplay experience in surprising ways. And we've seen examples of how a localized piece of text can improve or surpass the original text. This look at Underta/e's English-to-Japanese localization has been a real learning experience.",
        "raw": "We've also seen how culture and language are so closely tied together that\nsometimes a literal translation just isn't possible. We've examined how a single\nlocalization choice can affect the gameplay experience in surprising ways. And\nwe've seen examples of how a localized piece of text can improve or surpass\nthe original text. This look at Underta/e's English-to-Japanese localization has\nbeen a real learning experience.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29151676,
          0.27958571,
          0.89350454,
          0.38357857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
