    {
      "id": "p0262-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In addition to learning about Underta/e's localization, we've learned a lot about translation and localization in general. Some key discoveries include:",
        "raw": "In addition to learning about Underta/e's localization, we've learned a lot about\ntranslation and localization in general. Some key discoveries include:",
