    {
      "id": "p0262-b007",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Translation isn't simply replacing all the words in one language with all the words in another - it involves intent, figurative meaning, functional meaning, emotional impact, cultural background, artistic nuance, and more",
        "raw": "Translation isn't simply replacing all the words in one language\nwith all the words in another - it involves intent, figurative meaning,\nfunctional meaning, emotional impact, cultural background, artistic\nnuance, and more",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.33782351,
          0.48047857,
          0.87715383,
          0.54643571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.30104961,
          0.47976429,
          0.8784708,
          0.54750714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          27,
          28,
          29,
          30
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "• 翻译不只是把一种语言的所有词换成另一种语言的词。它还涉及意图、比喻意义、实际功能、情感效果、文化背景、艺术韵味等。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
