    {
      "id": "p0262-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "I guess all of this is a fancy-pants way of saying that translation isn't black and white at all - it's more like red and green and yellow and smurple, all stuck together with melted bubble gum, motor oil, and that ball of tangled wires you keep in a box somewhere. Even so, a good translator can navigate the mess and make things work.",
